fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9060665Z Note: a multi-user installation is possible. See https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/installation/installing-binary.html#multi-user-installation
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9071121Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9178877Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9188155Z ^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9188661Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9192829Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9193555Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9194876Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9195795Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9196268Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9196576Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9197189Z    if you are ready to continue.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9197510Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9198144Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9198991Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9199709Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9200262Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9200539Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9200799Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9201229Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9201546Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9202404Z    can use Nix.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9202618Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9202786Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9203031Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9203638Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9204364Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9204680Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9204888Z I will:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9205145Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9205339Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9205735Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9206118Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9206496Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9206755Z  - install Nix in /nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9207003Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9207390Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9207885Z    /root
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9217469Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9218336Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9226960Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9227494Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9227808Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9228205Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9228661Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
