fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9244971Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9253464Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9254089Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9254520Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9254781Z 
