fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9256123Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9256416Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:30:53.9256531Z If you would like to
